      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Something new about &lt;a href=&#34;http://sources.redhat.com/lvm2/&#34;&gt;LVM2&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://sources.redhat.com/lvm2/&#34;&gt;LVM&lt;/a&gt; is a logical volume manager for the Linux kernel.&#xA;It was originally written in 1998 by Heinz Mauelshagen, who based its design on that of the LVM in HP-UX.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
